Contributing

Thank you for your interest in contributing to this project!

How to Contribute

1. Fork the repository.
2. Create a new branch for your changes.
3. Make your changes and test them.
4. Submit a pull request describing your changes.

Reporting Bugs

Please report bugs by opening an issue. Include a clear description of the problem and steps to reproduce it.

Suggesting Enhancements

Suggestions for new features and improvements are welcome. Please open an issue describing your idea.

Code Guidelines

* Write clear and readable code.
* Keep changes focused and simple.
* Update documentation when necessary.
* Test your changes before submitting a pull request.

Community

All contributors are expected to follow the project’s Code of Conduct.

Thank you for helping improve this project!
